 "notes": "No openly published Okuma OSP programming manual found. okuma.co.jp/support offers only catalog download (via a form, okuma.satori.site); okuma.com/manuals and the okuma.com manual blog answer 403; manuals are said (search snippet of that blog) to come via distributor request / on-control. The P300 white paper (S1) was fetched and contains no G-code syntax. G15 H, G56, etc. therefore all UNKNOWN; memory says OSP uses G15 H<n> for work-coordinate select and G56 H for length offset, unverified. Third-party copies (manualmachine.com OSP-P200M Programming Manual Pub 5228-E-R9; Scribd G-code lists; wpi.edu OSP-U100M) noted, not used."
